{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See or survive? 1-4 players must choose in this prototype for a social co-op horror game. Make noise to illuminate your path. But careful, dangerous creatures are lurking in the dark, standing between you and long-lost treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ILLUMINATE YOUR PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the glowing mushrooms to navigate through this light-deprived underground environment. Trigger them by making noises in-game, via voice chat or use them like a torch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any means necessary to stay undetected. Sneak to make less noise, distract the creatures or sacrifice a friend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND ANCIENT TREASURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find all the ancient treasures long lost in these abandoned mining tunnels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEST PLAYED TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for the best experience. But that doesn't mean you always have to cooperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/ffc9da22339f1b3119f0920936039773.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a prototype. Gameplay is limited. Bugs are to be expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear experience of approx. 15-30min play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone strongly recommended.\u00a0The game is designed with in-game voice chat in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu controls:  mouse &amp; keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game controls: controller</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/d90f0a850f58c6924cf8f09471d7edac.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARACHNOPHOBIA - This game contains potentially triggering depiction of spider-like creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/8c9f5e931bc28effd631dac935fb2632.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are two life-long best friends on our journey into video game development. For this prototype, we asked ourselves what if you had to make noise in order to see. The outcome is HUSH. A social coop horror game. In its current state it covers only a fraction of the ideas we would like to feature in a commercial version. And quite frankly, we hate that we created an overly polished prototype lacking gameplay. Nevertheless, we hope you'll enjoy it. If you do, please leave us a review and feel free to follow us on Discord to see what we\u2019ll create next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921710?t=1759998732","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/a6a73c7d04ab319f46a9f682a0228ef4f0cf6fd4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759998732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/ac4db402e0ae16474aa2a0d1690a7e54e3bcf5c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759998732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/ac4db402e0ae16474aa2a0d1690a7e54e3bcf5c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759998732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See or survive? 1-4 players must choose in this prototype for a social co-op horror game. Make noise to illuminate your path. But careful, dangerous creatures are lurking in the dark, standing between you and long-lost treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ILLUMINATE YOUR PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the glowing mushrooms to navigate through this light-deprived underground environment. Trigger them by making noises in-game, via voice chat or use them like a torch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/bf32ee5d2b59ced92878f466f174bdbc.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any means necessary to stay undetected. Sneak to make less noise, distract the creatures or sacrifice a friend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/37ae46e8ccb9166164becffc6050fd55.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND ANCIENT TREASURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find all the ancient treasures long lost in these abandoned mining tunnels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/da0c5623565a5a61fd20690b9803d48a.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEST PLAYED TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends for the best experience. But that doesn't mean you always have to cooperate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.poster.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.webm?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/b67ad14c4cbe513f2d43dee173079ff8.mp4?t=1759998732\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/ffc9da22339f1b3119f0920936039773.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a prototype. Gameplay is limited. Bugs are to be expected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear experience of approx. 15-30min play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone strongly recommended.\u00a0The game is designed with in-game voice chat in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu controls:  mouse &amp; keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game controls: controller</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/d90f0a850f58c6924cf8f09471d7edac.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARACHNOPHOBIA - This game contains potentially triggering depiction of spider-like creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/extras/8c9f5e931bc28effd631dac935fb2632.avif?t=1759998732\" width=1404 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are two life-long best friends on our journey into video game development. For this prototype, we asked ourselves what if you had to make noise in order to see. The outcome is HUSH. A social coop horror game. In its current state it covers only a fraction of the ideas we would like to feature in a commercial version. And quite frankly, we hate that we created an overly polished prototype lacking gameplay. Nevertheless, we hope you'll enjoy it. If you do, please leave us a review and feel free to follow us on Discord to see what we\u2019ll create next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BLUE HOUSE Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921710/87581c36ff008c0ca635859a5bb801d6d9460bec/header.jpg?t=1759998732","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921710/1733313886/35774eb30cafee6ea77102f95c6b9f8ba6c45c14/1759247598/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759998730","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921710/1733313886/35774eb30cafee6ea77102f95c6b9f8ba6c45c14/1759247598/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759998730","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3921710/1733313886/35774eb30cafee6ea77102f95c6b9f8ba6c45c14/1759247598/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759998730","id":257209386,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209386/movie480.mp4?t=1759998730","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209386/movie_max.mp4?t=1759998730"},"name":"HUSH Prototyp